// ELF - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

# ELF header of a program whose payload is "Hello World!".
# e_ident, then e_type=2 (ET_EXEC), e_machine=62 (x86-64).
7F 45 4C 46 02 01 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
02 00 3E 00 01 00 00 00
